From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:49:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] libwifi_hal: export libwifi_hal_headers module

When libwifi-hal is provided as a vendor prebuilt, it does not export
its include directory. Expose libwifi_hal_headers so consumers such as
android.hardware.wifi-service-lib can still include wifi_hal/*.h.

---
 libwifi_hal/Android.bp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libwifi_hal/Android.bp b/libwifi_hal/Android.bp
index 0000000..1111111 100644
--- a/libwifi_hal/Android.bp
+++ b/libwifi_hal/Android.bp
@@ -249,3 +249,9 @@ cc_library_shared {
         integer_overflow: true,
     },
 }
+
+cc_library_headers {
+    name: "libwifi_hal_headers",
+    proprietary: true,
+    export_include_dirs: ["include"],
+}
-- 
